{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55572","headline":"叹景禅吟 · 道怤","name":"叹景禅吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹汝景禅去何速，虽不同道当眼明。\n个今永却不曾亏，地水火风还故国。\n好也好，也大奇，忙忙宇宙几人知，莹净宁闲追路绝，青山绿嶂白云驰。\n歌好歌，笑好笑，谁肯便作此中调。\n难提既与君凑机，其肯无不谐其要。\n格志异，气骨高，森萝咸会一灵毫。\n虽然示作皆同电，出岫藏峰徒思劳。\n希奇地，剑吹毛，脱罩腾笼任性游。\n此界他界如水月，几般应迹妙逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道怤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}